        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso yavativulira, “Munyi simwasoma aga Daudi yakola ing'inga yene yila lwa yaali nilienya ikindu cha valia? Oyo harara na vandu veve vaali ninzara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.25",
