              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kunangwa yingira munyumba ya Nyasaye nalia imigadi Mitakatifu ijahaanwa ku Nyasaye. Yaga gekoleka lwa Abiazari yaali Musaalisi Munene. Kolondekana ni Lilaga lietu, si gaduukanaa mundu wundi woosi kulia mugadi yigu, nivatali Avasaalisi venyine; navuzwa Daudi yaagulia kandi naguhana ku yavo avayaali harara navo.”",
          "type": "text",
